{title: Copper Sky}
{artist: The Demo Band}
{key: Am}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}
{capo: 2}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]Copper sky over [F]empty fields
[C]all the things the [G]summer steals
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Say my [G]name like you [Am]used to
[F]slow and [G]low like the [E]river [Am]do
{end_of_chorus}
